---
description: TDD discipline
alwaysApply: true
---

- Step sequence inside a PR:
  1. Commit `test(<crate>): <id> failing <name>` that is RED locally.
  2. Commit `feat(<crate>): <id> implement <name>` that makes it GREEN.
  3. Optional `refactor(<crate>): <id> <name>` with tests still green.
- Exceptions (declare in PR body):
  a) Pure refactor behind green tests.
  b) Generated code.
- Prefer the cheapest sufficient test tier.
- Every new public item must ship with a test in the SAME PR.
